#: ../../upstream/docs/user/build-customization.rst:2
msgid "Build process customization"
msgstr "构建过程定制"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/build-customization.rst:4
msgid ""
"Read the Docs has a :doc:`well-defined build process </builds>` that works "
"for many projects. We also allow customization of builds in two ways:"
msgstr "Read the Docs 拥有 :doc:`定义良好的构建过程 </builds>`，适用于许多项目。我们也允许以两种方式定制构建："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/build-customization.rst:7
msgid "Customize our standard build process"
msgstr "定制我们的标准构建过程"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/build-customization.rst:8
msgid ""
"Keep using the default commands for MkDocs or Sphinx, but extend or override"
" the ones you need."
msgstr "继续使用 MkDocs 或 Sphinx 的默认命令，但扩展或覆盖你需要的部分。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/build-customization.rst:11
msgid "Define a build process from scratch"
msgstr "从零定义构建过程"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/build-customization.rst:12
msgid ""
"This option gives you *full control* over your build. Read the Docs supports"
" any tool that generates HTML."
msgstr "此选项给你对构建的*完全控制*。Read the Docs 支持任何生成 HTML 的工具。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/build-customization.rst:16
msgid "Extend or override the build process"
msgstr "扩展或覆盖构建过程"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/build-customization.rst:18
msgid ""
"In the normal build process, the pre-defined jobs ``checkout``, "
"``system_dependencies``,  and ``upload`` are executed. If you define a :ref"
":`config-file/v2:sphinx` or :ref:`config-file/v2:mkdocs` configuration, the "
"``create_environment``, ``install``, and ``build`` jobs will use the default"
" commands for the selected tool. If no tool configuration is specified, "
"these jobs won't execute anything by default."
msgstr ""
"在正常构建过程中，预定义任务 ``checkout``、``system_dependencies`` 和 ``upload`` 会被执行。如果你定义了"
" :ref:`config-file/v2:sphinx` 或 :ref:`config-file/v2:mkdocs` "
"配置，``create_environment``、``install`` 和 ``build`` "
"任务将使用所选工具的默认命令。如果未指定工具配置，这些任务默认不执行任何操作。"

