#: ../../upstream/docs/user/build-customization.rst:83
msgid ""
"The current working directory is at the root of your project's cloned "
"repository."
msgstr "当前工作目录位于项目克隆仓库的根目录。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/build-customization.rst:84
msgid ""
"Environment variables are expanded for each individual command (see "
":doc:`/reference/environment-variables`)."
msgstr "环境变量会在每条命令中展开（见 :doc:`/reference/environment-variables`）。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/build-customization.rst:85
msgid ""
"Each command is executed in a new shell process, so modifications done to "
"the shell environment do not persist between commands."
msgstr "每条命令在新的 shell 进程中执行，因此对 shell 环境的修改不会在命令间持久化。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/build-customization.rst:86
msgid ""
"Any command returning non-zero exit code will cause the build to fail "
"immediately (note there is a special exit code to :doc:`cancel the build "
"</guides/build/skip-or-cancel-builds>`)."
msgstr ""
"任何返回非零退出码的命令将立即导致构建失败（注意有一个特殊退出码可用于 :doc:`取消构建 </guides/build/skip-or-"
"cancel-builds>`）。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/build-customization.rst:88
msgid "``build.os`` and ``build.tools`` are required when using ``build.jobs``."
msgstr "使用 ``build.jobs`` 时需要 ``build.os`` 和 ``build.tools``。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/build-customization.rst:89
msgid ""
"If the :ref:`config-file/v2:sphinx` or :ref:`config-file/v2:mkdocs` "
"configuration is defined, the ``create_environment``, ``install``, and "
"``build`` jobs will use the default commands for the selected tool."
msgstr ""
"如果定义了 :ref:`config-file/v2:sphinx` 或 :ref:`config-file/v2:mkdocs` "
"配置，``create_environment``、``install`` 和 ``build`` 任务将使用所选工具的默认命令。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/build-customization.rst:91
msgid ""
"If neither of the :ref:`config-file/v2:sphinx` or :ref:`config-"
"file/v2:mkdocs` configurations are defined, the ``create_environment``, "
"``install``, and ``build`` jobs will default to run nothing, giving you full"
" control over the build process."
msgstr ""
"如果既未定义 :ref:`config-file/v2:sphinx` 也未定义 :ref:`config-file/v2:mkdocs` "
"配置，``create_environment``、``install`` 和 ``build`` 任务默认不运行任何操作，让你完全控制构建过程。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/build-customization.rst:96
msgid "Where to put files"
msgstr "文件放置位置"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/build-customization.rst:98
msgid ""
"It is your responsibility to generate HTML and other formats of your "
"documentation when overriding the steps from :ref:`config-"
"file/v2:build.jobs.build`. The contents of the "
"``$READTHEDOCS_OUTPUT/<format>/`` directory will be hosted as part of your "
"documentation."
msgstr ""
"覆盖 :ref:`config-file/v2:build.jobs.build` 步骤时，由你负责生成文档的 HTML "
"和其他格式。``$READTHEDOCS_OUTPUT/<format>/`` 目录的内容将作为文档的一部分托管。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/build-customization.rst:101
msgid ""
"We store the base folder name ``_readthedocs/`` in the environment variable "
"``$READTHEDOCS_OUTPUT`` and encourage that you use this to generate paths."
msgstr "我们将基础文件夹名 ``_readthedocs/`` 存储在环境变量 ``$READTHEDOCS_OUTPUT`` 中，建议你用它来生成路径。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/build-customization.rst:103
